Aircraft graphics

The aircraft graphics (the sprite images in src/gfx and the previews in docs/previews) are rendered from third-party 3D models from 3D Warehouse (used under the 3D Warehouse General Model License). They are not covered by the CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 license above, and the rights in the 3D models remain with their owners. The graphics may be used and redistributed, including through the OpenTTD content service, only as part of this aircraft set.